ion":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-29T11:03:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-29T12:40:58Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n-Reproducible in: 4.0.stable, 4.1.stable, 4.2.stable, 4.3.stable, 4.4.stable, 4.5.stable, 4.6.stable\n\n### System information\n\nManjaro Linux - Vulkan 1.4.325 - (Forward+) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti (Driver Version: 590.48.01)(CUDA Version: 13.1)\n\n### Issue description\n\nwith [Embed Game on Next Play] off:\nWhen resizing the game window my dragging the borders for to long will freeze the game and if you continue the whole pc. Then you wait for the game window to update (takes a while). \nAfter the game window has updated, the fps is between 5 and 30 when the scene is normally like 160 fps.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/025e7bfe-d0d2-4a1b-9e50-652b18e995df\n\nupdating the window size quickly may fix the fps drop.\nResizing by code will not case this to happen.\n\nWhen doing this in 4.3 and lower: The ram will be used until the kernel kills Godot.\nDoing this in the 4.6 the ram usage goes up a by like 5 gb, but it will also goes down when you release the window.\n\nThis also happens on export.\n(also have run this in a compiled version of 4.6 with verbose on it: No logs when resizing the window)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nturn off [Embed Game on Next Play]\nrun game\nresize game-window by dragging the sides continuously\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new-game-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24933505/new-game-project.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115568/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115568/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}